words="Manali, Solang aur Kasol, | teeno ek hi trip mein, | aur group bhi aisa ki | sirf 16 se 36 saal wale log. | Raat ko Delhi se niklenge | aur subah aankh khulne par | seedha Manali mein. | Pehle din Hidimba Temple, | Old Manali ke cafe, | Mall Road pe shopping, | aur raat ko hotel mein bonfire, | aur sabhi logon ke saath | bahut saari gappe maarenge. | Agle din Solang Valley jaayenge, | wahan paragliding, ATV, | jo mann kare woh chalao. | Mausam ne saath diya toh | Atal Tunnel se hote hue | Sissu bhi jaayenge, | aur raat ko phir se music night. | Teesre din Manikaran Sahib Gurudwara, | phir Kasol, | nadi kinare cafe mein baithenge, | market ghoomenge | aur wahan se seedha Delhi wapas. | Hotel, breakfast, dinner, travel, | sab package mein include rahega, | aur poore trip pe ek trip captain | aapke saath rahega, | jo aapko ek doosre se connect rakhega | aur koi dikkat bhi nahi hone dega. | Toh aapko koi dikkat nahi hone wali. | Details chahiye toh | neeche Book_Now pe click karo, | seedha WhatsApp mein baat karte hain."
